<description>&lt;p&gt;The International Court of Justice ruled that Myanmar committed genocide against the Rohingya, prompting the U.K. to sanction five senior Myanmar military officials. Malaysia is repatriating another 6,803 Myanmar nationals despite the ruling. Myanmar’s armed forces continue to deploy landmines, leading to the world’s highest landmine casualty toll for a third straight year, and a rebel fighter lost a leg to a mine but vowed to return with a prosthetic limb. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/nov/24/myanmar-found-guilty-genocide-should-israel-be-worried-podcast&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNM0Fta1BkcGNCQ3ZRMmRYZ055QmhtMjNuQW83d0hUbWJEOGo3SmloTmdENnZmdFQwS0ptVlRFWGFocS1BNGhSNm1xMGdPdEpSVnA1Z0FjY0YwTkVObnctcS01WXRleXlxZUJNRk1zYU9YNlZRcFZJNm1OcklnczhRbzBfc1ROeFJDSmxhMm9LOUNBeEtEd3p2NVlfamo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQdjFkZ2JDbm9zS191dGVPU01XcElTSW1xNEVmbG5vbGRCZC1aaDhyRS1uazQ5bkFvZ2lvcVhWRGxxVTlYUTBpUUVtWktteTRSdFFkQ0R1cG5UdXQtUWVtTzF6UURfN0dzN3RvV0gtMVZ3Q2hPYmhRUVdlQWo0Z3VuMEI4LUZoMWZnaFZBMGxDekdyN2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQcTM0NE1zU252NFRsODRyY2Noalp3MVQ3SXFyUDEzaUhTa0t3eWJpRnhGNkVXU2RVNHV5MlNxYzFpcW5mTjQ0NEVMQlZVbDV3dnF2dHFfdmF5UHFGSG52Sm5yMGJ4VFlRSHZ6VEhkZmFhTlJkYzhIWl81ejNUMkdlQ1JhQ3hpUGgweGtSbm1URVprdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Politics Today&lt